      "observed": "The net /LED_3.3V_POWER_SW contains only the anodes of LEDs D4, D14, and D23. It has no source, driver, pull-up, or connection to +3V3 or any other supply.",
      "expected": "A net named /LED_3.3V_POWER_SW that feeds LED anodes should be connected to a 3.3 V supply or a driven switched 3.3 V rail so the LEDs can be forward biased. Standard practice for indicator LEDs requires an anode supply path.",
